Package: neoterm
Architecture: amd64
Depends: \${shlibs:Depends}, \${misc:Depends}, libvulkan1, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libasound2
Description: GPU-accelerated terminal emulator with tabs and themes
 NeoTerm is a modern GPU-accelerated terminal emulator written in pure Rust.
 It features hardware-accelerated rendering via wgpu, tabs and splits with
 1-cell dividers, search with floating pill overlay, command palette,
 session management, shell integration, Vi-style copy mode, performance HUD,
 and lazy pane rendering.
